nnectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MaskPreview+"}, "order": 32}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["不要看这个\n图层遮罩：sam2 ultra 细节方法 一定要改成 vitmatter（local），否则报错\n\n服饰这个工作流是集合了自动抠图功能，可以把非纯色背景的物体抠出来，防止融合的时候出现错误\n\n对象检测器是florence2，提示那里填写要抠出的物体名称，分单数和复数，例如human和humans，这个的模型使用large（大），边界框选择是all（一定选all，不能选别的），排序左右，上下无所谓\n\n抠图的工具是sam2 ultra，模型选择2.1 large，边界框选择是by index，针对检测到的序列号，在选择索引上选好对应数字\n\n为了给透明背景增加纯色背景，连接了移除alpha节点（图层工具：图像移除alpha），背景填充一定要打开，否则变回原图\n#000000是黑色，#FFFFFF是白色"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [535.3933715820312, 229.22239685058594], "pos": [918.74853515625, -2425.9501953125], "id": 43, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["因为在runninghub上florence用不了，所以单用sam进行抠图\n\nsam model 选择 hq vit h 2.57g\ngrounding dino model 选择 swinb 938m\n\n\n\ndetailed method 选择 vitmatter（local）\n\nprompt填写要抠的图的英文名称\n\n移除alpha是给抠出来的透明图添加一个纯色背景，000000代表黑色"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [535.3933715820312, 229.22239685058594], "pos": [1481.069091796875, -2413.486083984375], "id": 63, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["制作iclora图像节点，是可以把两组图像组合到一起的节点，这个节点比换装工作流中的好用\n\n图像几和遮罩几要对应，否则出错\n方向选择左右"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [567.2451171875, 163.4349822998047], "pos": [1699.0189208984375, -383.7590637207031], "id": 54, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["作图之前一定要先把人物蒙版做出来，否则会报错\n蔗渣漏洞填充是可以把想要添加遮罩的地方画个圈，就会自动把里面的遮罩给填充了"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [567.2451171875, 163.4349822998047], "pos": [986.9660034179688, -376.9343566894531], "id": 64, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["模型fill\n因为有遮罩，所以添加差异扩散\n因为是fill模型所以引导30-50\n图像裁剪的位置保持不动（top left）"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [567.2451171875, 163.4349822998047], "pos": [2786.406982421875, -1776.3525390625], "id": 55, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STYLE_MODEL", "links": [15], "label": "风格模型", "type": "STYLE_MODEL", "localized_name": "风格模型"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [2847.2861328125, -879.8523559570312], "widgets_values": ["flux1-redux-dev.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "style_model_name"}, "name": "style_model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "风格模型名称"}], "flags": {}, "id": 16, "type": "StyleModelLoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.67", "widget_ue_connectable": {"style_model_name": true}, "Node name for S&R": "StyleModelLoader"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["redux模型应用\n下采样因子选1,1是最强的\nmode选择keep aspect ratio\n\nredux模型应用只连接参考图像就可以了，不用联结遮罩\n\n\n风格模型加载器选择flux1 redux dev\n\nclip视觉加载器选择 vision 384"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [353.4560546875, 250.30148315429688], "pos": [3516.344970703125, -912.035888671875], "id": 51, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 15}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-2322.7359067063044, 1415.2828989620912], "scale": 0.9646149645000078}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "文生图", "bounding": [2378.5966796875, -1590.4833984375, 2428.04833984375, 574.0252075195312]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "服装", "bounding": [913.4113159179688, -2106.20654296875, 1398.5653076171875, 896.8314819335938]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "redux风格迁移", "bounding": [2833.10009765625, -962.8566284179688, 635.3178100585938, 317.6000061035156